# Cook-a-roon (ahtUrhgan 15): a level 75 Warrior in Nashmau with three of each fish. Ququroon (no script; default 241,
# the offer's own csid). Available: a fish trade: no section-1 trade handler: nothing; Ququroon 241, option 0: nothing;
# 241 again, option 1: begun. Accepted: Ququroon 242; one Ahtapot alone: not the five: nil; the five fish: Prog =
# randomInt(2, 3) and 243 ([7] = the draw), a GM pins Prog 2; finished: the Bowl of Nashmau
# Stew (Prog 2), completed (no reward table), the trade confirmed. Completed: Ququroon 244; the five fish: 243 ([7] =
# the draw), a GM pins Prog 2; update 243: the trade confirmed, the stew (Prog 2), Prog 0; finished. The Prog 3 arms are
# `#draws`. The draws are the script RNG on both sides (Player.RandomInt): the replay's [7] must match.
lists Nashmau/Ququroon/onTrigger Nashmau/Ququroon/onTrade Nashmau/onEventFinish/241 Nashmau/onEventFinish/243 Nashmau/onEventUpdate/243
char zone=Nashmau pos=-0.9,0,66.824 job=WAR lvl=75
item Ahtapot x3
item Istakoz x3
item Istavrit1 x3
item Istiridye x3
item Mercanbaligi x3
login
trigger Ququroon                        # walks beside him; available: 241
finish option=0                         # not option 1: nothing
trade Ququroon Ahtapot x1 Istakoz x1 Istavrit1 x1 Istiridye x1 Mercanbaligi x1   # available: no trade handler: nothing
finish-if-event
trigger Ququroon                        # available: 241
finish option=1                         # begun
trigger Ququroon                        # accepted: 242
finish
trade Ququroon Ahtapot x1               # not exactly the five: nil
finish-if-event
# Prog = randomInt(2, 3); 243 ([7] = Prog)
trade Ququroon Ahtapot x1 Istakoz x1 Istavrit1 x1 Istiridye x1 Mercanbaligi x1
charvar Quest[6][15]Prog 2              # a GM pins the draw (the 243 sent carries the drawn value)
finish                                  # Prog 2: the stew; completed (Prog cleared); the fish taken
trigger Ququroon                        # completed: 244
finish
# completed: Prog = randomInt(2, 3); 243 ([7] = Prog)
trade Ququroon Ahtapot x1 Istakoz x1 Istavrit1 x1 Istiridye x1 Mercanbaligi x1
charvar Quest[6][15]Prog 2              # a GM pins the draw
update 243 option=0                     # the fish taken, the stew (Prog 2), Prog 0
finish                                  # no completed-section finish: nothing
